néficiez du statut fiscal LMNP, permettant une exonération d'impôt sur vos revenus locatifs. Le bail commercial assure le versement des loyers, que le logement soit occupé ou non.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"684 avenue du Club Hippique","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjNkMTc0ZDdlMTU0NDhkMzFhZGIyZGEzNDI2YTZmZWZkZDEyYzljOGEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI0NDBjM2YwN2ZhZmNlYTM4M2ZiMjEwZTNiOTllNzE0YiJ9?signature=cc6fc74cde336eb47516b2e4df98a3935a3a2ec39e87316e13880bd8e7da781e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjZlNzdjOTU1ODJjMDIyNWEzMmU0OTFiOTE2YWVkNTRmYWMxMzRhZTAiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxYmY4ZGIyMmFmMDhhOTMxMzcwODUzMDM0ZjRlZjg0YSJ9?signature=517857343d3d5cf8fa205be38abb1c3cf73a77c02ef3960c01f9829c36c09b8e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQ3NmIyZDMyMGFlMzJkOTczYTEwOWE1ZTVhZWQwY2E5YzEyNzQzYTIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkZTZhMTM2ZTNiNTE1YmEwZjI3NzEzYTk4NmJmMDE2YiJ9?signature=829c2163014ec52bbb79e502f787406a7e4b393a70c0c8d17c3a4a5b4c91a14b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjBmODcyYWU0YThmNWRmMjZjY2JmYTZkN2QyMWVhZDc3NWY0ODQ2OTMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxMGQxNDdlN2NlM2NlZDljNzk0NDEyNDgyY2UxNjA3ZiJ9?signature=74bf72968c01f0a1e4dd406a0399dbf3f86c11b6d597ac2cd5bbbc898c82c818","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjRkNTVlNjUxY2EwMTc3Yzk5ZDMzMjk5ZjViNmI4MTUwNj